# Selective Git
*
!*/
!.gitignore
!.pre-commit-config.yaml
!security/.baseline.security
!README.md

# Black List - Make sure that variation on .env will be excluded no matter what 
.env
.env.*
security/.env
security/.env.*
env/.env
env/.env.*

# Whitelisted Assets #
## Nix Files ##
!flake.lock
!flake.nix
# uv files
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
## Python ##
!*.py

## CI ##
# Narrow on purpose: the workflow directory only, not all YAML.
!.github/workflows/*.yml

## Render config ##
# The pandoc defaults file: engine and fonts, read by the render entry point.
!hermetica/scribe/*.yaml

## Test fixtures ##
# Synthetic by-ID records. There is no generator: this file IS the source of
# truth, and test_fixture.py guards its shape and its synthetic-ness.
!tests/fixtures/*.json

## Data base ##
# Should be tracked but I don't want to export the actual data base on github.
# Open the data base folder but not the actual db
!db/
